==================================================
36. SECURITY
==================================================

Use Supabase Row Level Security.

Customers:

Can read public active products.

Can manage their own:

favorites
addresses
orders

Customers cannot:

Modify products
Modify categories
Modify other customers
Modify admin data

Admins:

Can manage products
categories
orders
promotions

Never expose service-role keys in the browser.

Use environment variables.

==================================================
37. STORAGE
==================================================

Create Supabase Storage buckets:

products

categories

banners

avatars

Product images should be optimized.

Use appropriate image dimensions.

Do not upload enormous original images unnecessarily.

