==================================================
57. PAYMENT ARCHITECTURE
==================================================

MVP:

Cash on Delivery

Create a payment service abstraction.

Future providers should be easy to add.

Possible future integrations:

Chapa
Telebirr
Other Ethiopian payment providers

Do not hardwire checkout directly to one provider.

Create an abstraction such as:

PaymentProvider

The implementation can initially use:

CashOnDeliveryProvider

