==================================================
62. DO NOT COPY THE ORIGINAL SCREENSHOT
==================================================

The provided screenshot is reference material.

Analyze its strengths:

- Product-focused
- Strong category discovery
- Flash sale
- Mobile navigation
- Shopping-oriented layout

Improve its weaknesses:

- Too many competing elements
- Too many pills
- Dense visual hierarchy
- Inconsistent spacing
- Too much content above the fold
- Some unclear CTA hierarchy

Liyueka 2.0 should be:

Cleaner
More spacious
More readable
More premium
More intuitive

