65. PHASE 0 — INITIALIZATION
==================================================

First inspect the current project.

Do not overwrite existing work without understanding it.

Determine:

- package manager
- existing dependencies
- project structure
- existing environment variables
- existing routes
- existing components

Then establish the architecture.

If the project does not exist, initialize the Next.js application.

Use TypeScript.

