==================================================
85. IMPORTANT CLAUDE CODE BEHAVIOR
==================================================

Do not stop after creating a few pages.

Continue phase by phase.

After each phase:

1. Inspect implementation
2. Run typecheck
3. Run lint
4. Run tests where available
5. Fix errors
6. Review responsive behavior
7. Continue to next phase

If something is ambiguous:

Choose the simplest production-safe approach.

Do not ask unnecessary questions.

If an external service is unavailable:

Create a clean abstraction and mock implementation.

Do not block the rest of the project.

