[ ] Accessibility reviewed

[ ] Error states implemented

[ ] Loading states implemented

[ ] Empty states implemented

[ ] TypeScript passes

[ ] Lint passes

[ ] Production build passes

==================================================
87. FINAL COMMAND
==================================================

Start by inspecting the current project.

If no existing project exists, initialize it.

Then begin PHASE 0.

Do NOT attempt to build every feature in one step.

Build sequentially.

After each phase, verify the work before continuing.

The final result should feel like a real premium Ethiopian e-commerce startup, not a template or coding demo.

Prioritize:

UX > visual polish > unnecessary features

Simple > complicated

Fast > flashy

Trustworthy > gimmicky

Mobile-first > desktop-first

Production-ready > prototype-looking

Begin now.